      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I hope you are well and that things are coming favorably for you. I am sure my failure to acknowledge your appreciated favor of December 6th last, must have been deeply disapointing. Please pardon! I can hardly explain further than that, wish- ing to thank you personaly for such a favor, I put your brief letter aside and, some how or other it was simply \"snowd under.\" However, I am sure God has blessed you just the same, and you have been included in our prayers as noted at the time. Besides this, I am going to offer my first - next - \"Free Mass\" for your intentions, your guidance, and welfare. Incidently we have the privilege of two such \"free-Masse \" each month.",
      "per_polygon": "I hope you are well and that things are coming favorably for you. I am sure my failure to acknowledge your appreciated favor of December 6th last, must have been deeply disapointing. Please pardon! I can hardly explain further than that, wish- ing to thank you personaly for such a favor, I put your brief letter aside and, some how or other it was simply \"snowd under.\" However, I am sure God has blessed you just the same, and you have been included in our prayers as noted at the time. Besides this, I am going to offer my first - next - \"Free Mass\" for your intentions, your guidance, and welfare. Incidently we have the privilege of two such \"free-Masse \" each month.",
